        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Fennel Spool banking trojan sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01572. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Fennel Spool Banking Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01572)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Fennel Spool Banking Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Fennel Spool banking trojan in campaign PTF-01572.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"6d8443ececf6b33dc68a063934a7002268e6ccd51a9f28edec140592a56c0f76\", \"f668d1e35522dd2075ccd4b71d4c88f4c3e03a6b728fbf2285d09441015cf68e\", \"5a212a34aa0d188c9587c19e68d7c8167cc9cbe26fccc2c0cafbf5b831b1cb4f\", \"958c52a4464b45bfd30093ae3319bec3db820f6561217ad79744838b94efe09b\", \"03670f2a1bd1e3997b7e2e1febabec275f5ab125e5d6be3557f618871dca14d5\", \"aad56e36f8b646fd41ae2ab03a8c3bee5e2a75d4865a2b51f30b5a074aa07fe7\", \"b64087585088183b03945b2995941328841974efe393a3c1557494c59e07aff7\", \"067ff6ac536dc39d304a6e668c6704597696d45b96915f86feab398402dc60b8\", \"25039616529ece8e5f654a0582aa5e9730c7eb00145a8f77ceb5a0e9dcba307d\", \"379ef8028e59f76b79b4848242608fe075f4a03ec838d6f9272fe1bec1c37771\")",
